## Key Concepts
- Online complex-valued whitening and demixing (AuxIVA-style)
- Cross-bin permutation alignment using phase and energy cues
- Nonstationarity tracking and confidence-based forgetting
- Latency-conscious design for CPU/DSP hardware

## Code Example
